## Notes for the raise (not for the model)

- **Partial by design:** item 1 only. Items 2 (project notes), 3 (post-deploy md5 assertion; see the
  ticket's comment about KS-656's served-spec leg) and 4 (sweep other single-file mounts, e.g. nginx
  confs) stay open on KS-987.
- **Same file as KS-890's brief** (queued in the same batch), disjoint regions: KS-987 inserts after
  `:73`, KS-890 after `:96`. Each patch applies alone at the tip; the second to merge re-anchors by 10
